WEBVTT

00:02:57.584 --> 00:03:00.332
can call a survivor a liar
at one of his rallies,

00:03:00.356 --> 00:03:01.695
and the crowds will roar.

00:03:03.817 --> 00:03:06.833
And all across the world,
where Me Too has taken off,

00:03:06.857 --> 00:03:08.913
Australia and France,

00:03:08.937 --> 00:03:12.301
Sweden, China and now India,

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:16.381
survivors of sexual violence
are all at once being heard

00:03:16.405 --> 00:03:17.825
and then vilified.

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:23.870
And I've read article
after article bemoaning ...

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:28.110
wealthy white men

00:03:28.134 --> 00:03:31.429
who have landed softly
with their golden parachutes,